{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_08_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2c8159c618c95287c1f606cac37d6eb4017fc316dd0fb459ae2076d857f4adb0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:367831cc87430f9631f7483e6e0c5fae6df18c052075ef0d4ff1cca34f8c88fc",
      "text": "节目正式开演……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a244b69893cb8d83a1c54ac5fad057ba946d77f0aa15f638f401cb0f4466e33",
      "text": "接下来登场的，是最近引发热议的315 Production！\n据说他们拥有很多经历独特的偶像哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60c49d87e585ee0e5e512657cb10cfe4c070f0887e90fcc8fd92439b0b1ea7b5",
      "text": "顺便问一下，F-LAGS的各位\n都有着怎样的经历呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f011055a4891ea249ffaf6951c93afa924da627b96762db66712ee446c1b6c3f",
      "text": "可能有些人已经知道了，\n我以前做过女性偶像！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05540dbc23f35e2b8db0bd864890b2ec62944652581ddbecc92154732738e9d4",
      "text": "俺跟偶像完全不沾边，\n原本是在家里帮忙做家业的。然后老师是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c40781e46c6682f54c1b82037fdcf2b8d62684a644a32f2def295c0283b8a624",
      "text": "…我是小说家。虽然现在已经不写了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92bfa2a67e7a5d167422623192d0bc46394a723c0b19f2257ed9e66fb42a805a",
      "text": "小说家转行当偶像！那可真少见！\n难怪最近大众都对各位如此关注呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:637beff5e9fefd689cb6e529ecdb836436adb745d1442365863d7c5811220d8b",
      "text": "是的。我们的经历各不相同。也正因如此，\n才有唯独我们才能做到的事情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3c76baa53394414be4c2e343307498192de7fad66e61292ee8463c69974fff7",
      "text": "在接下来的舞台上，我们想展现出这一点。\n请大家多多关注哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f7b1efa139153e58c6a6963241a353a72d3bb3819d82cd9a19b39667230fbfe",
      "text": "非常感谢。那么事不宜迟，\n就请F-LAGS的三位带来演唱！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000180:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72b317b217c602e585ad52bc334a819e3770dacfad46958b8448638b10a0bbfa",
      "text": "（要是跟其他偶像比起来，\n俺的歌声和舞蹈肯定还差得远。但是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000185:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0287c519226384d3c9c8c38096f9432dba49c9315783669f106381b4149f58be",
      "text": "（俺非常清楚笑容的重要性。\n正因如此，俺才拥有能够鼓舞凉的笑容）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000192:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d073627e371d8d7fdc99595f5a9952081097da6ebecf7db6610fdb379bb83872",
      "text": "（伙伴夸奖过的笑容。\n这就是俺最强的武器！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000211:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15479d0e0ab83ef9e79d3894a782b877592f4a786ea1038778e96d9ea49e1f1d",
      "text": "（那天，我坦白自己其实是男孩子的地方，\n也是在音乐节目上）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000216:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4e2fd3fdfde1a9a4824924548e9a0f90120461db784a38a7e785a00e4c38067",
      "text": "（坦白之后，遭到了封杀，\n被各种各样的人责备……即便如此）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000220:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42bc138e299dc07c99e14420b9e02abfb8e1728ba929dccb7848021e67e968f9",
      "text": "（为了想成为男性偶像的梦想，\n我绝不退缩，一路走到了这里）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000227:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bbea24f9040a91357c96e985dee0375860b5b5e24ae9ff1803f201ab15349d4",
      "text": "（在今天的舞台上，我要把不断向前的身影\n传递出去！传递给那些正打算放弃梦想的人！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000246:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67739b4a2e9f63a9658242edb6164ea1f22dc8dc542d1f75385076bb9bce1656",
      "text": "（…偶像九十九一希能够带去笑容的人数，\n或许还很少。但是…）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000251:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3e1d5709b9b57ffef88b1e16c63992f30994356876f30729e8b187e46d709c2",
      "text": "（…我不是父亲的替身，也不是任何人的替身。\n我想用我自己的力量，去带给人们快乐）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000257:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93d50ba99ad38ee3b4c88392f2b1193aebd1e616269c3fe031f079e653d660bb",
      "text": "（…唯有这份心情，我想要毫不虚假地传递出去！）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
